+/* review 0174-w-d4b-hwwrite-r1 F9 (sweetwlan=14): the RC interrupt enables ELBI 0x10/0x14/0x18 (SWW_RC_IRQ0_EN..IRQ2_EN, patch 0133), read only, right before the 0xC34 unmask:
